      <rules>
        <rule name="The Strands of Fate" id="2920-0548-37c8-9091" hidden="false">
          <description>In each of your turns, you can choose to re-roll a single failed hit or wound roll, or a single failed saving throw for Brother-Captain Stern. However, if you do so, your opponent can re-roll a single failed hit or wound roll, or a single failed saving throw for one of their models in their next turn.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
