            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Model with Nemesis weapon only. Each time the bearer is selected to fight, you can re-roll one hit roll and one wound roll when resolving the bearer&apos;s attacks</characteristic>
