          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time the bearer would lose a wound as a result of a mortal wound, roll one D6: on a 4+ that wound is not lost
- Each time an attack is allocated to the bearer, subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of that attack (to a minimum of 1)</characteristic>
